(text "VL813 POWER, DECOUPLING AND CLOCK — CANDIDATE CIRCUIT" (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "721b5fa3-944b-5f61-a5f1-36a6a94831b0"))
(text "U1.18 feeds HUB_3V3; U1.39 drives L3; U1.37 senses HUB_1V2.\nU1.40 remains unresolved (datasheet lists DC12FB; published project leaves it open)." (at 15.24 78.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f97591b2-3061-5194-8609-2c51d2d6bc30"))
(text "Supply-pin bypass allocation is stored on each C20-C35 as Placement target. Values and layout require qualification." (at 15.24 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7b025d5c-df9a-5c9d-b86e-ce19f81c0110"))
(text "Clock and bias" (at 15.24 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a86e670-57fa-5a06-8572-609db241b0f2"))
(text "Clock: 25MHz / 22pF candidates; crystal CL, ESR, drive and parasitics remain unqualified. SSREXT value remains TBD.\nU12 monitors HUB_3V3, CT open: 12-28ms delay. J9 requests reset; C38 now bypasses U12, replacing the old reset RC.\nRequire HUB_3V3 >= 3.20V steady for worst-case reset release; verify LDO tolerance under load.\nDoes not monitor HUB_1V2 or implement optical recovery. Core-rail sequencing, clock startup and reset timing require tests." (at 15.24 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7e8aab60-397c-5305-bf3e-a042566987fc"))
(text "J7 feeds hub, four switched ports and SFP regulator. Connector rating, input protection and total budget remain pending." (at 15.24 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bcfc34d2-c355-5884-a025-e8c0010d8f2c"))
(embedded_fonts no))
